le=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">와 회의비</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(1</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">회</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 1</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">인당 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">만원</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">로 구성</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">예산 작성 시 문의사항이 있으시면 센터로 연락 바랍